normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:24px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><b style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;line-height:24px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">角色背景</b></div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:48px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">高剑父，与高奇峰、陈树人同为岭南画派创始人。1906年在日本加入了同盟会，是黄花岗起义敢死队的队长，同盟会广州分会会长。黄花岗起义后炸死清朝官员凤山的炸药就出自他的手。</div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:72px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">潘达微，画家，中国新闻摄影、人体艺术摄影的先驱之一。同盟会广州分会副会长。广州起义失败，潘冒险出头，将72死难者殓葬于黄花岗。事后流亡上海、香港等地。1929年夏季病逝于广州。南京国民政府追念其贡献，特明令褒扬，准他的遗体附葬黄花岗坟场。</div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:48px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">罗仲霍，黄花岗七十二烈士之一。参加发动广州起义，随黄兴攻两广督署，伤左足，误走旗人街，被执缚，仍痛斥清吏，遂遇害。<sup style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;margin:0px 0px 0px 2px;padding:0px 2px 0px 2px;color:rgb(51, 102, 204);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">[8]</sup><a style="font-size:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;color:rgb(19, 110, 194);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-bottom:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-right:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-left:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"></a></div><div style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:18px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:0px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"></div><div style="font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;" microsoft="" yahei',="" simhei,="" verdana;line-height:24px;margin:35px="" 0px="" 15px="" -30px;color:rgb(51,="" 51,="" 51);text-align:start;float:none;overflow:hidden;width:808px;height:24px;border-top:0px="" none="" rgb(51,="" 51);border-bottom:0px="" 51);border-right:0px="" 51);border-left:12px="" solid="" rgb(79,="" 156,="" 238);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0,="" 0,="" 0)="" url("http:="" baike.bdimg.com="" tatic="" iki-lemma="" ormal="" esource="" mg="" aratitle-line_c5e6d61.png")="" repeat="" 0%="" 0%;'=""><h2 style="font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;" microsoft="" yahei',="" simhei,="" verdana;line-height:24px;padding:0px="" 8px="" 0px="" 18px;color:rgb(0,="" 0,="" 0);text-align:start;float:left;width:88px;height:24px;border-top:0px="" none="" rgb(0,="" 0);border-bottom:0px="" 0);border-right:0px="" 0);border-left:0px="" 0);text-decoration:none;background:rgb(255,="" 255,="" 255)="" repeat="" 0%="" 0%;'="">影片评价</h2><a style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;font-family:SimSun;line-height:22px;padding:0px 0px 0px 24px;color:rgb(136, 136, 136);text-align:start;float:right;width:39px;height:22px;border-top:0px none rgb(136, 136, 136);border-bottom:0px none rgb(136, 136, 136);border-right:0px none rgb(136, 136, 136);border-left:0px none rgb(136, 136, 136);text-decoration:none;background:rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat 0% 0%;">编辑</a></div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:72px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">《英雄喋血》是一部既有革命的暴力又有黄花的清雅，并带有明显岭南文人智慧与特色的电影。在这场“明知不可为而为之”的起义中，黄花岗革命英雄以自身为火把，照亮了辛亥革命的成功之路，他们的牺牲又因为潘达微的收尸殓葬之举取得了心灵觉醒的圆满。<i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">（新浪娱乐评）<sup style="font-size:12px;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;margin:0px 0px 0px 2px;padding:0px 2px 0px 2px;color:rgb(51, 102, 204);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">[9]</sup><a style="font-size:0px;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;color:rgb(19, 110, 194);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-bottom:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-right:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-left:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"></a></i></i></div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:48px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">电影里岭南风情随处可见，无论是高剑父、潘达微笔下别具风格的岭南派画作，还是西关大屋的腰门趟栊，都能让人感受到“广味十足”。张弛有度的节奏、充满诗意的画面、丰满细腻的人物刻画，也让这部主旋律电影精彩度飙升。<i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">（羊城晚报评）</i></i></div><div style="font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 15px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:48px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">这部以黄花岗起义为主题的电影，将视角对准了平均年龄不到30岁的多位革命志士，以及冒死为烈士收尸的“幕后”英雄潘达微，借香港导演赵崇基之手，用磅礴大气的画面，再现了这段史诗般厚重的热血题材。<i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><i style="display:inline;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">（新浪娱乐评）<sup style="font-size:12px;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;margin:0px 0px 0px 2px;padding:0px 2px 0px 2px;color:rgb(51, 102, 204);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 102, 204);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;">[10]</sup><a style="font-size:0px;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;line-height:0px;color:rgb(19, 110, 194);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-bottom:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-right:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);border-left:0px none rgb(19, 110, 194);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"></a></i></i></i></i></div><div style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:18px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:0px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"></div><div style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:18px;margin:30px 0px 30px 0px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:270px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat 0% 0%;"><div style="font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:18px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);text-align:start;float:none;width:790px;height:40px;border-top:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);border-right:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);border-left:0px none rgb(51, 51, 51);text-decoration:none;background:rgb(245, 245, 245) none repeat 0% 0%;"><span style="font-size:19px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;" microsoft="" yahei',="" sans-serif;line-height:40px;padding:0px="" 0px="" 10px;color:rgb(51,="" 51,="" 51);text-align:start;float:none;border-top:0px="" none="" rgb(51,="" 51);border-bottom:0px="" 51);border-right:0px="" 51);border-left:0px="" 51);text-decoratio